GlassineOS wvkbd
================

This branch is the on-screen keyboard of GlassineOS (https://github.com/GlassineOS):
wvkbd 0.21 (https://github.com/jjsullivan5196/wvkbd) plus three changes, one commit
each:

  - themable keys: --stroke, --stroke-sp, --stroke-width and --gap (the shell
    passes its theme's look). The pressed-key label (--text-press, --text-press-sp)
    and --no-popup were added here for 0.16; upstream has them since, so this
    branch uses upstream's. A swiped key's label is --text's unless --text-swipe
    is given (upstream's default is white), as it was in 0.16.
  - a German QWERTZ layer ("german") with umlauts
  - long press (--hold MS, default 400, 0: off): a held key types the
    alternate printed in its corner (":" on ".", ";" on ",", symbols on the
    letters). Only the German layer has alternates.

Without the new options, and on upstream's layers, the keyboard behaves as
upstream's.

Branches:
  glassine/0.21   what GlassineOS builds
  glassine/0.16   the release Alpine 3.22 packaged (kept)

Build: as upstream (make; needs wayland, pango, cairo, xkbcommon, scdoc).

The license is upstream's (GPL-3.0, LICENSE). Commits made with AI assistance
carry an Assisted-by: trailer. They are not submitted upstream; see the
GlassineOS contribution policy.
